  {
    "id": "506D1E00-0729-5A2B-BF31-B331573D0D62",
    "kind": "Trait",
    "system": "pf2e-remaster",
    "systemVersion": "1.2.10",
    "name": "Tandem",
    "slug": "tandem",
    "descr": "Actions with this trait involve you and your eidolon acting in concert. You can't use a tandem action if either you or your eidolon can't act, if you haven't Manifested your Eidolon, or if you've Manifested your Eidolon in a way where it isn't a separate entity (such as with the [Meld into Eidolon](/feat/meld-into-eidolon-impossible-magic-feat-feat-9227) feat). Tandem actions often let both you and your eidolon take separate actions, but these must be actions taken separately by you and your eidolon; you can't use a tandem action to take another tandem action.",
    "data": {
      "rarity": "common",
      "traits": [
